      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 1118,
      "height": 23,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "text": "Only what you explicitly COPY crosses the line.  Compilers, caches and dev packages stay behind in stage 1.",
